# Cloudflare Pages' asdf preset is named "extended_X.Y.Z", not "X.Y.Z" -
# using the bare version number fails Cloudflare builds with
# "No preset version installed for command hugo". Keep the "extended_" prefix.
# The Cloudflare Pages HUGO_VERSION env var must be bumped to the same bare
# X.Y.Z - Preview when this change merges, Production when it is released (see
# the release pre-check in docs/runbook.md). It decides which Hugo gets
# installed and this file decides which one runs, so a mismatch fails the build
# with the same error. See docs/current-state/cloudflare-config.md.
hugo extended_0.168.0
